Roboco-sensei drew this one!

488
00:54:58,328 --> 00:55:00,451
見て、なんかすっごい、もう…
Look, it's like super, already...

489
00:55:00,236 --> 00:55:04,416
[Title: おなかいっぱいだべちゃお皿]
[Title: Stuffed Full Chomping Plate]

490
00:55:00,472 --> 00:55:05,432
いっぱい食べる気満々の沼にハマってるロボ子とロボサ。
Roboco and Robosa, who are fully in the mood to eat a lot and caught in the swamp.

491
00:55:05,452 --> 00:55:07,152
めちゃめちゃ可愛いでしょ?
Super cute, right?

492
